# Frontend evidence — parallel plan fan-out swimlanes (ADR 0022, R-3 parallel variant)

Scope: `apps/web-ui/` only, plus `apps/web-ui/design/03-screens/R-3-live-timeline.md`.
Built against the FIXED wire contract in the design doc's Part 6 ("Contract"
section) rather than the backend's actual code, since the two halves were
implemented in parallel in the same tree and were not integration-tested
against each other end-to-end as part of this evidence — see "Honest
limitations" below.

## Build

```
$ pnpm --dir apps/web-ui build
tsc -b && vite build
